From 4ff13a845e66333ad578d169b1412853eeaea626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: napatc1 <napatchoomchaiyot@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:52:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rewrite the Windows app in Java

The Windows scanner and window were PowerShell plus a C# wrapper. They are now
one Java app in windows/ with no libraries: Mod Analyzer, Injection Checker,
System Check, reference-code reports and the PrimeTiers-style window, plus a
--cli mode. Memory reading and DLL listing call Windows directly through the
Java foreign function API, so there is no helper to compile.

ModAnzer.ps1 stays as a short pointer to the download for old links.
ModAnzer.bat now runs ModAnzer.jar. README and website are updated.
